Tenali Rama and the Half Reward (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100097

One day, a man came to the royal court with a complaint.

He said that a guard at the palace gate had taken half of his reward as a bribe to let him enter.

The king was angry and asked Tenali Rama to find out the truth.

Tenali called the guard and asked, “Did you take anything from this man?”

The guard denied it.

Tenali then said, “This man came to give me a reward for my help. I promised to share half of whatever I receive with the guard at the gate.”

The guard quickly said, “Yes, that is true! I should get half!”

Tenali smiled and said, “Your Majesty, I have not received any reward yet. But this guard has already claimed half of it.”

The king immediately understood the truth.

The guard had exposed himself with his own greed.

The king punished the guard and praised Tenali Rama for his cleverness.

💖 Moral:

Greed can expose the truth.
